		<br><br>

		<<link [[Encourage <<him>> to buy something|Stall Encourage]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Flirt|Stall Flirt]]>><<set $enemytrust += 20>><<stallCustomerArousal>><<set $stall_seduced to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<gtrust>><<glust>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Tell <<him>> to leave|Stall Leave]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $rng is 7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		<<stall_init>>
		A <<person>> stops in front of your stall. "Looking for something for the <<spouse>>," <<he>> says. <<He>> leans down and <<stall_check_text>>. "How much for <span class="green"><<stall_amount>></span> of these?"
		<br><br>

		<<stall_trust>>
		<br><br>

		<<stall_sell_actions>>
	<<elseif $rng is 8>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		<<stall_init>>
		A <<person1>><<person>> snatches one of your <span class="green"><<print setup.foodstuff[$stall_expensive].plural>></span> as <<he>> walks by, and breaks into a run.
